msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "Dysk USB"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "nie uruchamia się"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Ustawienia: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Najnowszy log"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Zgłoś problem"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Pobiera najnowszy log i otwiera wypełniony formularz GitHuba: dołącz tam "
"log."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:314
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report it works"
msgstr ""

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Opens GitHub's game compatibility form, filled in: say how well it runs "
"there, then post it."
msgstr ""

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Opcje uruchamiania (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"Pierwszy wiersz, który nie jest pusty ani nie jest komentarzem (# lub ;), "
"jest dodawany do wiersza poleceń programu."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:325
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Zmienne środowiskowe (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:325
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Jedna NAZWA=wartość w wierszu, ustawiana przed startem gry."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:326
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Dodatkowe logowanie (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:327
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Tylko gdy prosi o to zgłoszenie, na przykład err+all,+seh. Potem wyczyść: "
"to spowalnia grę."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:332
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Nie wczytano gier: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:345
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "Brak zachowanych logów."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:349
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "wystąpił problem"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:352
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Nie wczytano logów: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:362 title/pc5_web_page.html:363
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "utracono połączenie"

